also empties own colostomy with towels supplied by nurse [**First Name (Titles) **] [**Last Name (Titles) 5247**];

requested dilaudid 8 mg IV x2 as of writing this note, pt stated she preferred to have dilaudid IVP so it would 'work faster', however this nurse chose to drip in 8 mg over 1 hr in IV piggyback bag--pt observed to sleep after both administrations;
also requested ambien at hs;

receiving multiple IV abx as ordered;

