pt's RA sat 95-7% when awake, down to 92% during sleep;

g-i/[** **]:
requested food at about 20:30; given soup and peanut-butter [**Location (un) **]; pt ate about [**1-2**] of the [**Location (un) **], few bites of the soup; drank 120 cc's milk;
pt ordered for and received 2 units humalog insulin for FS 238, pt's FS dropped to 65, MD notified, pt given juice to drink; repeat approx 30 minutes later showed 49, given 1 amp D50 IV; repeat 30 minutes showed >110;
received hs glargine abit late d/t low FS; MD changed dose to 12 u, then changed dose back to 9 units--pt received 9 units at approx 23:00;
over the night, pt's FS's in desired ranged, max 189, mid 140's at aprpox 04:00;

encouraged pt to try to eat meals when arrive;

receiving IV PPI; also received Calcium Carbonate per pt request at approx 02:30;

