facial scabs noted; MD aware, stated pt scratches self;

access:
1 Rt forearm [**Name (NI) 1719**], pt c/o burning slightly and transiently a couple hours after IV D50;

pt comfort;
requested Morphine IV x1 at approx 21:30, for abdn'l pain, stated "achy", pt appeared comfortable following having received med;
also recieved Benedryl 25 mg IV x2 for generalized skin itchiness-MD asses pt prior to ordering;
pt fairly awake for 2 1/2 hours at midnight to early a.m. hours; asked for pain med, stated Ambien "didn't work", stated Trazadone did; pt ordered for and received Trazadone 50 mg PO with good effect, pt observed sleeping restfully following;

